1
00:00:09,176 --> 00:00:13,261
Silver Lion Venice International Film Festival 1953

2
00:00:18,352 --> 00:00:26,772
Daiei Productions Presents

3
00:00:31,532 --> 00:00:36,903
UGETSU MONOGATARI

4
00:00:40,249 --> 00:00:42,866
Produced by NAGATA Masaichi

5
00:00:43,001 --> 00:00:45,994
From Ugetsu monogatari by Ueda Akinari

6
00:00:46,129 --> 00:00:49,588
Screenplay by KAWAGUCHI Matsutaro YODA Yoshikata

7
00:00:49,716 --> 00:00:51,708
Cinematography by MIYAGAWA Kazuo

8
00:00:51,843 --> 00:00:55,427
Art Direction by ITO Kisaku Music by HAYASAKA Fumio

9
00:01:16,910 --> 00:01:18,244
Cast

10
00:01:19,288 --> 00:01:21,996
KYO Machiko as Lady Wakasa , MITO Mitsuko as Ohama

11
00:01:22,124 --> 00:01:24,161
TANAKA Kinuyo as Miyagi

12
00:01:24,293 --> 00:01:28,913
MORO Masayuki as Genjuro , OZAWA Sakae as Tobei

13
00:01:29,047 --> 00:01:31,039
AOYAMA Sugisaku as the Priest

14
00:01:31,174 --> 00:01:35,464
KAGAWA Ryosuke as the Village Chief , MORI Kikue as Lady Wakasa 's Nurse

15
00:01:35,596 --> 00:01:38,384
AMANO Ichiro as the Boatman , SAWAMURA Ikio as Genichi

16
00:02:02,623 --> 00:02:06,458
Directed by MIZOGUCHI Kenji

17
00:02:11,256 --> 00:02:15,876
Ugetsu monogatari by Ueda Akinari

18
00:02:16,011 --> 00:02:21,006
continues to enchant modern readers with its mysterious fantasies .

19
00:02:21,141 --> 00:02:26,136
This film is a new refashioning of those fantasies .

20
00:02:40,410 --> 00:02:43,244
Early Spring , 16th Century The Age of Civil Wars

21
00:02:43,372 --> 00:02:46,706
North shores of Lake Biwa in Omi Province

22
00:03:20,367 --> 00:03:22,359
What could that be ?

23
00:03:22,494 --> 00:03:26,238
They must be executing Shibata 's spies .

24
00:03:26,373 --> 00:03:30,538
I need to sell all this before the fighting starts .

25
00:03:30,669 --> 00:03:33,286
Can you sell it in Nagahama ?

26
00:03:33,422 --> 00:03:38,133
I hear business is booming there since Lord Hashiba 's forces arrived .

27
00:03:38,260 --> 00:03:41,719
- Can 't I go with you ? - No , no women .

28
00:03:41,847 --> 00:03:44,806
There 's no telling what lawless soldiers will get up to .

29
00:03:44,933 --> 00:03:48,847
Besides , you have to stay and take care of little Genichi .

30
00:03:48,979 --> 00:03:56,523
Go , then , if that 's what you want ! Some samurai you 'll make , you fool !

31
00:03:56,653 --> 00:03:59,066
How high can a man rise without big dreams ?

32
00:03:59,197 --> 00:04:01,940
Ambition must be as boundless as the ocean .

33
00:04:02,075 --> 00:04:06,319
You must be dreaming ! You can 't even handle a sword .

34
00:04:07,330 --> 00:04:10,539
You should stick to the trade you know or you 'll regret it .

35
00:04:10,667 --> 00:04:12,499
Just wait until I 'm rich .

36
00:04:12,627 --> 00:04:16,917
I swear by the god of war , I 'm tired of being poor .

37
00:04:17,048 --> 00:04:19,381
Genjuro , please take me with you .

38
00:04:19,509 --> 00:04:22,092
Still at it ? Forget your foolish dreams .

39
00:04:22,220 --> 00:04:25,839
- Let me pull the cart . - Stop it , you fool !

40
00:04:25,974 --> 00:04:30,639
He 's delusional , he thinks a big future awaits him in Nagahama .

41
00:04:30,771 --> 00:04:32,512
What an idiot !

42
00:04:32,647 --> 00:04:34,604
Back soon , Miyagi .

43
00:04:58,173 --> 00:05:04,465
They 're too greedy for their own good . And not just Tobei . Genjuro , too .

44
00:05:04,596 --> 00:05:10,843
I tell you , quick profits made in chaotic times never last .

45
00:05:10,977 --> 00:05:13,845
A little money inflames men 's greed .

46
00:05:14,981 --> 00:05:19,817
They 'd do better to prepare for the coming war .

47
00:05:21,404 --> 00:05:25,489
- Tell Genjuro that when he returns . - I shall .

48
00:05:28,328 --> 00:05:30,365
Thank you for your advice .

49
00:05:37,629 --> 00:05:39,621
Your father 's back !

50
00:05:43,385 --> 00:05:45,217
Welcome back .

51
00:05:47,055 --> 00:05:48,921
Here ...

52
00:05:50,308 --> 00:05:51,975
Look !

53
00:05:53,186 --> 00:05:56,224
- What 's this ? - What do you think ?

54
00:05:56,356 --> 00:05:58,814
You got that for your wares ?

55
00:06:00,151 --> 00:06:02,689
Feel the weight of it .

56
00:06:02,821 --> 00:06:07,191
Never seen so much , have you ? I hurried back just to show you .

57
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:14,205
That 's what I call trade ! Now do you understand ?

58
00:06:18,879 --> 00:06:20,666
What about Tobei ?

59
00:06:20,797 --> 00:06:25,167
He came across a fine-looking samurai in Nagahama .

60
00:06:25,302 --> 00:06:29,296
I tried to stop him , but he insisted on following the samurai .

61
00:06:58,835 --> 00:07:01,703
I beg of you , sir ! I beg of you !

62
00:07:01,838 --> 00:07:04,626
Please , I beg of you , sir !

63
00:07:04,758 --> 00:07:08,968
Let me be your vassal ! I 'll serve you unto death , sir !

64
00:07:09,095 --> 00:07:14,432
- Accept a beggar as a vassal ? - Get some armour first !

65
00:07:14,559 --> 00:07:17,927
- Armour and a spear ! - Get lost , beggar !

66
00:07:18,063 --> 00:07:20,180
Then can I be a samurai ?

67
00:07:20,315 --> 00:07:22,307
Get lost !

68
00:07:33,328 --> 00:07:35,445
Not you again ?

69
00:07:35,580 --> 00:07:37,822
Get some armour and a spear !

70
00:07:49,344 --> 00:07:52,883
You look so nice ! Happy now ?

71
00:07:55,100 --> 00:07:57,092
Very smart indeed .

72
00:08:01,147 --> 00:08:05,187
It 's like the Bon festival and New Year 's all rolled into one .

73
00:08:07,195 --> 00:08:12,907
For years I 've wanted to buy you a kimono but I could never afford it .

74
00:08:13,034 --> 00:08:15,026
Now I finally can !

75
00:08:16,413 --> 00:08:19,656
Just look at your face . You look so happy !

76
00:08:21,292 --> 00:08:26,504
It 's not the kimono but your kindness that makes me so happy .

77
00:08:30,051 --> 00:08:35,263
As long as you 're with me , I want for nothing in life .

78
00:08:42,564 --> 00:08:44,931
Just look at all this ...

79
00:08:45,942 --> 00:08:52,155
Dried fish , oil , flour , arrowroot and rice cakes .

80
00:08:52,282 --> 00:08:54,695
Money is everything , see ?

81
00:08:54,826 --> 00:08:57,910
Without it life is hard ,

82
00:08:58,038 --> 00:09:00,951
and all hope dies .

83
00:09:04,044 --> 00:09:07,833
Well , your father 's got work to do .

84
00:09:07,964 --> 00:09:09,796
Up we go .

85
00:09:10,925 --> 00:09:13,338
I will earn even more .

86
00:09:15,013 --> 00:09:18,177
I 'll try and make as much pottery as I can .

87
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:24,220
That last small batch brought in three silver coins .

88
00:09:24,355 --> 00:09:28,565
That 's enough talk of money . We have plenty now .

89
00:09:28,693 --> 00:09:34,280
The village chief says Lord Shibata 's troops could be here by tomorrow .

90
00:09:34,407 --> 00:09:36,273
We should be careful ...

91
00:09:36,409 --> 00:09:38,025
Nonsense !

92
00:09:38,161 --> 00:09:41,529
War 's always good for business . Just look how much I made !

93
00:09:41,664 --> 00:09:46,500
You were fortunate once . You may not be next time .

94
00:09:46,628 --> 00:09:50,713
- If anything happened to you ... - Stop imagining the worst .

95
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,752
Oh , Ohama ...

96
00:09:53,843 --> 00:09:57,928
- Brother ... - You mustn 't worry .

97
00:09:58,056 --> 00:10:01,891
No samurai would hire a peasant dressed in rags like him .

98
00:10:02,018 --> 00:10:04,635
Don 't you worry , he 'll be back .

99
00:10:04,771 --> 00:10:07,184
Have something to drink , here .

100
00:10:17,117 --> 00:10:18,733
You fool !

101
00:10:19,702 --> 00:10:22,194
Have you come to your senses ?

102
00:10:22,330 --> 00:10:24,868
You look like a beggar .

103
00:10:24,999 --> 00:10:27,833
You 've become the village idiot !

104
00:10:49,983 --> 00:10:52,521
Keep it turning , come on .

105
00:10:55,113 --> 00:10:58,072
Get him out of here ! He 's in the way .

106
00:10:58,199 --> 00:11:00,361
We won 't make it if we don 't hurry .

107
00:11:00,493 --> 00:11:04,533
Stay out of the way , now . Go and sit down .

108
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:09,037
Mother , I 'm hungry .

109
00:11:09,169 --> 00:11:12,378
What a pest !

110
00:11:12,505 --> 00:11:15,543
Come on , come on , a few more turns !

111
00:11:20,388 --> 00:11:23,096
You 're a different man now ,

112
00:11:23,224 --> 00:11:26,058
always so irritable .

113
00:11:26,186 --> 00:11:31,306
All I want is for us to work in peace as husband and wife ,

114
00:11:32,483 --> 00:11:35,851
and for the three of us to live happily .

115
00:11:36,779 --> 00:11:39,362
That 's all I wish for .

116
00:12:13,691 --> 00:12:16,104
You really worked hard for me this time .

117
00:12:16,236 --> 00:12:18,353
I have a plan , that 's why .

118
00:12:23,618 --> 00:12:27,658
Let 's sell this new batch in Nagahama . We 'll make a fortune .

119
00:12:27,789 --> 00:12:32,955
- Will I get a share ? - Of course . A third of all we sell .

120
00:12:33,086 --> 00:12:37,000
I can 't wait ... I can 't wait to get my hands on that money .

121
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:47,306
I 've never seen those two work so hard before .

122
00:12:50,144 --> 00:12:53,637
They 've thrown everything into this kiln ,

123
00:12:53,773 --> 00:12:58,393
their strength , their souls , everything .

124
00:13:00,071 --> 00:13:04,406
I don 't know what will become of them if it all fails .

125
00:13:05,243 --> 00:13:08,327
Living together as a happy family is enough for me .

126
00:13:09,664 --> 00:13:15,001
But he insists on taking this risk . Men just won 't listen , will they ?

127
00:13:15,128 --> 00:13:18,337
Genjuro was always so level-headed before .

128
00:13:18,464 --> 00:13:21,298
War changes people , doesn 't it ?

129
00:13:21,426 --> 00:13:24,885
At least they 're trying to bring in some money .

130
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:28,217
I wonder what that is .

131
00:13:33,146 --> 00:13:36,639
Wake up , dear . Wake up .

132
00:13:39,402 --> 00:13:43,191
The rumour was true . They must be Shibata 's troops .

133
00:13:52,290 --> 00:13:53,747
See anything , Tobei ?

134
00:13:53,875 --> 00:13:57,835
The villagers are scattering like spiders !

135
00:13:59,422 --> 00:14:02,256
- What now ? - We must keep the kiln burning .

136
00:14:02,383 --> 00:14:05,672
I 'll be damned if I let that fire go out .

137
00:14:05,803 --> 00:14:09,547
They 're pillaging houses and rounding up men .

138
00:14:11,392 --> 00:14:14,059
Genichi !

139
00:14:20,651 --> 00:14:24,395
It 's Shibata 's army ! Hurry , run !

140
00:14:24,530 --> 00:14:27,273
Hurry , hurry !

141
00:14:31,704 --> 00:14:33,704
Hurry !

142
00:14:40,546 --> 00:14:46,008
Halt ! We 're taking men for forced labour ! Don 't try to resist !

143
00:14:47,637 --> 00:14:53,383
This is terrible ! Run for your lives ! Lord Shibata 's troops are here !

144
00:14:53,518 --> 00:14:57,387
They 're stealing everything ! Hide your valuables !

145
00:14:57,522 --> 00:15:01,015
- Don 't let them get your women ! - Hurry !

146
00:15:01,150 --> 00:15:04,439
They 're taking all men into forced labour !

147
00:15:04,570 --> 00:15:08,814
- They 're requisitioning everything ! - They 're like a pack of wolves .

148
00:15:08,950 --> 00:15:11,943
If only they 'd waited one more night !

149
00:15:12,078 --> 00:15:16,948
Hurry , let 's run . It 's too dangerous here . Hurry !

150
00:15:17,083 --> 00:15:21,168
If we lose this batch , I won 't get my share of the profits !

151
00:15:23,881 --> 00:15:28,251
You 'll lose your life for that kiln ! Come on !

152
00:15:28,386 --> 00:15:30,924
Come now , quickly !

153
00:15:31,055 --> 00:15:35,675
Boil some rice . We 'll need it in the mountains .

154
00:15:35,810 --> 00:15:38,803
Ohama ! Ohama , come quickly !

155
00:15:40,857 --> 00:15:42,473
Mother !

156
00:15:58,416 --> 00:16:02,911
Trying to hide , eh ? Come out , damn you !

157
00:16:05,131 --> 00:16:08,465
Help ! Please ! Help !

158
00:16:17,435 --> 00:16:21,850
Please have mercy ! Don 't take them ! Don 't leave us to starve !

159
00:16:21,981 --> 00:16:23,643
We 're begging you !

160
00:16:23,774 --> 00:16:26,517
No , please ! No !

161
00:16:29,780 --> 00:16:31,772
Out of my way !

162
00:16:32,909 --> 00:16:36,073
Out of the way , fool !

163
00:16:44,253 --> 00:16:45,920
Help !

164
00:17:31,759 --> 00:17:34,923
It 's ready . Here ...

165
00:17:40,017 --> 00:17:41,883
Thank you .

166
00:17:43,563 --> 00:17:45,976
Hurry and eat .

167
00:17:49,569 --> 00:17:53,358
- What 's happened to him ? - Hopeless fool !

168
00:17:59,620 --> 00:18:03,159
- Have you seen my husband ? - No , I haven 't .

169
00:18:35,948 --> 00:18:38,110
Who 's there ?

170
00:18:54,842 --> 00:18:57,630
It 's really quietened down .

171
00:18:57,762 --> 00:19:00,379
The guns are almost silent .

172
00:19:12,860 --> 00:19:14,692
Where are you going ?

173
00:19:14,820 --> 00:19:18,439
It 's too dangerous . Wait until the soldiers leave .

174
00:19:18,574 --> 00:19:20,611
Wait . It 's best to wait .

175
00:19:20,743 --> 00:19:22,905
I can 't wait ! I have to go !

176
00:19:23,037 --> 00:19:26,201
- Please don 't go ! - I can 't let the fire go out !

177
00:19:26,332 --> 00:19:29,370
Forget the kiln ! What if you 're caught ?

178
00:19:29,502 --> 00:19:35,169
- I can 't let the fire go out ! - We can always make more pots .

179
00:19:35,299 --> 00:19:38,667
Silence ! I can 't let the pots be ruined .

180
00:19:40,513 --> 00:19:42,220
Ohama ! Ohama !

181
00:20:00,658 --> 00:20:02,945
Damn it ! The fire 's gone out .

182
00:20:11,419 --> 00:20:15,288
- Dear ... - Too late . The fire 's gone out .

183
00:20:27,101 --> 00:20:28,933
Damn , it 's empty !

184
00:20:32,189 --> 00:20:36,479
- What was that ? Is someone hiding ? - Could be something hidden in there .

185
00:20:36,610 --> 00:20:38,943
Have a look .

186
00:20:59,341 --> 00:21:02,254
Nothing but pots .

187
00:21:02,386 --> 00:21:04,252
Let 's go .

188
00:21:33,292 --> 00:21:35,579
They 're done !

189
00:21:37,296 --> 00:21:39,913
Look ! They 're fired !

190
00:21:41,008 --> 00:21:43,921
Thank goodness they 're done !

191
00:21:44,053 --> 00:21:46,045
They 're done !

192
00:21:48,724 --> 00:21:50,215
Thank goodness .

193
00:21:50,351 --> 00:21:52,013
Are they done ?

194
00:21:52,144 --> 00:21:55,683
Yes , they are ! And very nicely , too .

195
00:21:55,815 --> 00:21:59,024
- Hurry and load them up . - So we 're off to Nagahama , then ?

196
00:21:59,151 --> 00:22:02,394
We can 't now . We 'll row across the lake .

197
00:22:02,530 --> 00:22:06,945
Ohama 's a boatman 's daughter . You do the rowing , okay ?

198
00:22:07,076 --> 00:22:11,241
- Can we get to the lake safely ? - We 'll take a shortcut to Onoe .

199
00:22:11,372 --> 00:22:13,284
Will we find a boat ?

200
00:22:13,415 --> 00:22:16,374
There are always abandoned ones there .

201
00:22:16,502 --> 00:22:18,869
Hurry , let 's unload the kiln .

202
00:23:02,298 --> 00:23:09,965
~ In the waters of Azuchi ~

203
00:23:24,695 --> 00:23:33,362
~ A little boat floats along ~

204
00:23:35,789 --> 00:23:40,456
~ All are asleep ~

205
00:23:52,222 --> 00:23:57,388
~ Slumped over the rudder ... ~

206
00:23:57,519 --> 00:24:00,603
We 've got to be careful , the fog is thick .

207
00:24:03,108 --> 00:24:07,068
Genichi , this is the lake . Isn 't it beautiful ?

208
00:24:08,697 --> 00:24:11,986
We 're finally out of danger .

209
00:24:12,117 --> 00:24:15,406
I 'm glad we decided to go by boat .

210
00:24:15,537 --> 00:24:18,780
If we 'd gone over land , we 'd probably be dead by now .

211
00:24:18,916 --> 00:24:21,499
We 'll reach Omizo by morning .

212
00:24:21,627 --> 00:24:25,792
That 's where Lord Niwa has his castle .

213
00:24:25,923 --> 00:24:29,087
The town 's even more prosperous than Nagahama .

214
00:24:29,218 --> 00:24:32,336
You and I will be rich men ,

215
00:24:32,471 --> 00:24:35,589
and our wives will be wealthy women .

216
00:24:37,977 --> 00:24:40,936
I 'll build a warehouse in our village .

217
00:24:41,063 --> 00:24:43,396
And I 'll buy a suit of armour .

218
00:25:15,514 --> 00:25:17,346
Another boat !

219
00:25:29,570 --> 00:25:31,527
It 's a ghost !

220
00:25:32,448 --> 00:25:35,282
No ... I 'm not a ghost .

221
00:25:37,411 --> 00:25:40,245
I 'm a boatman from Kaizu .

222
00:25:42,124 --> 00:25:45,868
I was on the way to Azuchi with my cargo ,

223
00:25:46,795 --> 00:25:49,629
when I was attacked by pirates .

224
00:25:51,133 --> 00:25:52,874
Water ...

225
00:25:54,094 --> 00:25:56,086
Give me water !

226
00:26:01,769 --> 00:26:03,385
Thank you .

227
00:26:15,157 --> 00:26:21,370
Wherever you 're headed , be on the lookout for pirates .

228
00:26:22,873 --> 00:26:24,990
If they see you ,

229
00:26:25,125 --> 00:26:28,914
you 'll lose your cargo and your lives .

230
00:26:30,464 --> 00:26:33,172
Take care of your women .

231
00:26:33,300 --> 00:26:34,836
Your women ...

232
00:26:48,899 --> 00:26:50,891
Merciful Buddha !

233
00:26:54,530 --> 00:26:57,318
Buddha have mercy on his soul .

234
00:27:03,330 --> 00:27:07,870
Let 's turn back . This is a bad omen .

235
00:27:12,381 --> 00:27:16,000
Let 's return the women to shore . We 'll continue alone .

236
00:27:16,135 --> 00:27:19,924
- Please don 't go . - I 'm staying ... to keep my eye on him .

237
00:27:20,055 --> 00:27:22,388
- They kidnap women . - I 'll risk it .

238
00:27:22,516 --> 00:27:26,180
I 'll go wherever you go . Please take me with you .

239
00:27:26,311 --> 00:27:29,679
- You must look after Genichi . - Take me with you !

240
00:27:29,815 --> 00:27:34,230
Ohama , take us back to shore . Quickly !

241
00:27:34,361 --> 00:27:37,399
Tobei , take us back !

242
00:27:55,424 --> 00:27:57,757
We 'll be back with the money soon .

243
00:27:57,885 --> 00:28:01,754
We 'll return within ten days . Wait for us .

244
00:28:03,765 --> 00:28:07,679
Don 't try to fight if pirates overtake you .

245
00:28:07,811 --> 00:28:11,555
I know , I know . Don 't take the main road .

246
00:28:11,690 --> 00:28:14,979
Remember what I said and take the mountain path .

247
00:28:15,110 --> 00:28:18,148
And don 't go back home right away . Understand ?

248
00:28:18,280 --> 00:28:22,194
These misfortunes will soon be over . Just be patient .

249
00:28:24,578 --> 00:28:27,742
Tobei , Ohama , please look after him for me .

250
00:28:27,873 --> 00:28:30,490
Don 't worry , we 'll be back soon .

251
00:28:30,626 --> 00:28:33,084
Take good care of Genichi .

252
00:28:33,212 --> 00:28:37,422
You 'll be surprised at all the silver we bring back .

253
00:28:37,549 --> 00:28:39,256
Father !

254
00:28:52,022 --> 00:28:54,014
Please be careful !

255
00:28:56,443 --> 00:28:58,560
Come back safely !

256
00:29:08,205 --> 00:29:11,198
- Father ! - Please be careful !

257
00:29:16,588 --> 00:29:18,750
Father !

258
00:29:48,287 --> 00:29:52,327
Buy our wares ! Buy our wares !

259
00:29:52,457 --> 00:29:54,119
Tea bowls ! Tea bowls !

260
00:29:54,251 --> 00:29:57,164
This ? Here you go . Many thanks .

261
00:29:57,296 --> 00:30:02,792
- Sake flasks and cups , too ! - Buy our wares !

262
00:30:30,454 --> 00:30:33,822
- I 'd like that vase , please . - This one , yes ?

263
00:30:35,625 --> 00:30:39,744
And that sake flask and those cups .

264
00:30:43,216 --> 00:30:49,213
And can we also take those rice bowls , plates and jars ?

265
00:30:49,348 --> 00:30:54,764
Yes ... rice bowls , plates and jars .

266
00:30:54,895 --> 00:31:00,061
We live at Kutsuki Manor . Please deliver them there .

267
00:31:01,276 --> 00:31:04,189
We will pay you then .

268
00:31:04,321 --> 00:31:06,438
Thank you .

269
00:31:21,296 --> 00:31:26,291
- The castle guard approaches ! - Make way for the castle guard !

270
00:31:27,636 --> 00:31:30,720
Don 't look ! You 'll only get your crazy ideas again .

271
00:31:30,847 --> 00:31:32,930
Shut up !

272
00:31:36,269 --> 00:31:41,185
If I had armour , I could be a samurai . Sword , spear , armour ...

273
00:31:41,316 --> 00:31:43,979
Don 't throw away our hard-earned money .

274
00:31:44,111 --> 00:31:46,694
- Leave me alone ! - Brother !

275
00:31:46,822 --> 00:31:48,905
- Tobei ! - Let go of me !

276
00:31:49,032 --> 00:31:52,525
Next time we meet , I 'll be a great samurai .

277
00:31:52,661 --> 00:31:55,119
Please stop him !

278
00:31:55,247 --> 00:31:56,954
Tobei ! Tobei !

279
00:32:12,347 --> 00:32:14,213
That got rid of her .

280
00:32:14,349 --> 00:32:17,308
- May I help you ? - A suit of armour , please !

281
00:32:20,647 --> 00:32:22,479
Tobei !

282
00:32:36,997 --> 00:32:40,411
- Do I look like a samurai ? - Yes , and a fine one .

283
00:32:40,542 --> 00:32:44,331
- But you need a spear . - I 'll take one !

284
00:32:47,632 --> 00:32:49,589
Here you are .

285
00:32:55,891 --> 00:32:57,507
How much ?

286
00:33:00,103 --> 00:33:02,095
One silver piece .

287
00:33:31,176 --> 00:33:33,168
Pretty , isn 't she ?

288
00:33:41,686 --> 00:33:43,393
Let me go !

289
00:33:45,774 --> 00:33:47,606
What are you doing ?

290
00:33:48,360 --> 00:33:50,272
Damn you !

291
00:33:53,156 --> 00:33:55,239
Murderers !

292
00:35:00,140 --> 00:35:02,132
There 's some money for you .

293
00:35:41,973 --> 00:35:43,839
Bastards !

294
00:35:47,145 --> 00:35:49,853
Look what 's become of me .

295
00:35:51,191 --> 00:35:54,775
Satisfied now , Tobei , seeing your wife reduced to this ?

296
00:35:56,446 --> 00:36:01,441
What do you care , anyway , now you think you 're a samurai ?

297
00:36:01,576 --> 00:36:04,239
Tobei , you wretched fool !

298
00:36:06,081 --> 00:36:08,368
You fool , Tobei !

299
00:36:37,904 --> 00:36:41,022
Would you watch over my stall until my partners return ?

300
00:36:41,157 --> 00:36:45,697
- Of course . - They should be back soon . Thanks .

301
00:37:14,691 --> 00:37:17,980
Sir , how much is one of these ?

302
00:37:18,111 --> 00:37:20,945
Are you looking to buy ?

303
00:37:21,072 --> 00:37:23,906
Depends on the price .

304
00:37:24,033 --> 00:37:28,027
They 're too luxurious for the wife of a man like you .

305
00:37:28,163 --> 00:37:30,155
I 've got money .

306
00:38:30,225 --> 00:38:31,966
Excuse me .

307
00:38:34,437 --> 00:38:38,932
We thought you might need us to show you the way .

308
00:38:39,067 --> 00:38:42,185
That 's very kind of you .

309
00:38:47,534 --> 00:38:50,197
Please follow us .

310
00:40:15,121 --> 00:40:17,704
Please come in .

311
00:40:17,832 --> 00:40:23,669
Well ... Thank you , but I should be getting back .

312
00:40:23,796 --> 00:40:27,836
Lady Wakasa is waiting for you . Please come inside .

313
00:40:27,967 --> 00:40:33,588
You say " Lady Wakasa " ... Are you referring to the young lady ?

314
00:40:33,723 --> 00:40:37,637
Yes , she is the daughter of the late Lord Kutsuki .

315
00:40:37,769 --> 00:40:42,230
Now please come through . No need to stand on ceremony .

316
00:41:24,273 --> 00:41:26,265
Many thanks .

317
00:41:34,367 --> 00:41:36,359
Come through .

318
00:41:44,127 --> 00:41:45,618
Please ...

319
00:43:01,788 --> 00:43:03,996
Please , come .

320
00:43:15,927 --> 00:43:20,467
You are Master Genjuro of Omi province , are you not ?

321
00:43:24,435 --> 00:43:27,428
How does your ladyship know my name ?

322
00:43:28,606 --> 00:43:33,818
When I saw your ceramics at the market ,

323
00:43:33,945 --> 00:43:36,983
I could hardly believe my eyes .

324
00:43:37,865 --> 00:43:43,987
The blue glaze on your pots gleamed as brightly as crystal .

325
00:43:46,165 --> 00:43:52,127
My father taught me a certain appreciation of such things .

326
00:43:53,631 --> 00:43:56,669
I wanted to meet you ,

327
00:43:56,801 --> 00:44:01,387
to ask how you manage to create such beautiful objects .

328
00:44:01,514 --> 00:44:05,929
But perhaps it is a trade secret , not meant for outsiders ?

329
00:44:06,060 --> 00:44:10,054
No , my lady , there is no special trade secret .

330
00:44:10,189 --> 00:44:15,935
But it takes many years ' experience to handle the clay and apply the glaze .

331
00:44:17,780 --> 00:44:21,023
The fruit of experience is beauty ,

332
00:44:21,159 --> 00:44:26,575
but only a master craftsman can create such beauty .

333
00:44:26,706 --> 00:44:28,322
Thank you , my lady .

334
00:44:56,485 --> 00:44:59,944
These are my wares , aren 't they ?

335
00:45:03,576 --> 00:45:08,321
I wanted to taste sake from your cups .

336
00:45:11,083 --> 00:45:14,747
You 're fortunate , my little ones , to catch this noble lady 's eye .

337
00:45:17,548 --> 00:45:21,633
I 'm a farmer , so the pottery is just a sideline ,

338
00:45:21,761 --> 00:45:26,756
but I feel for my creations , as if they were my own children .

339
00:45:28,017 --> 00:45:33,513
That such a noble lady would look kindly upon them is a great honour .

340
00:45:33,648 --> 00:45:39,895
To see them in such a grand residence ,

341
00:45:40,029 --> 00:45:43,739
graced by the touch of so beautiful a lady ,

342
00:45:44,951 --> 00:45:47,568
is like a dream come true .

343
00:45:47,703 --> 00:45:52,698
Not at all . They must be saddened by the touch

344
00:45:52,833 --> 00:45:55,997
of one fallen on hard times , such as myself .

345
00:45:56,128 --> 00:45:58,711
Please , take a cup .

346
00:46:01,968 --> 00:46:06,429
My wares have never looked so beautiful .

347
00:46:16,565 --> 00:46:22,232
The value of people and objects truly depends on their setting .

348
00:46:22,363 --> 00:46:27,825
My wares must be at a loss to find themselves in such a noble manor .

349
00:46:27,952 --> 00:46:34,449
Your talent must not be hidden away in some poor , remote village .

350
00:46:34,583 --> 00:46:40,170
You must strive to deepen and enrich your gift .

351
00:46:43,384 --> 00:46:46,923
And how might I do that , my lady ?

352
00:46:48,431 --> 00:46:51,799
By swearing your love for Lady Wakasa ,

353
00:46:51,934 --> 00:46:55,302
and pledging your troth to her at once .

354
00:48:04,590 --> 00:48:09,590
~ The finest silk ~

355
00:48:15,684 --> 00:48:20,684
~ Of choicest hue ~

356
00:48:26,904 --> 00:48:35,238
~ May change and fade away ~

357
00:48:48,134 --> 00:48:53,468
~ As would my life ~

358
00:49:00,062 --> 00:49:03,729
~ My beloved ~

359
00:49:11,073 --> 00:49:21,072
~ If thou shouldst prove untrue ~

360
00:49:38,559 --> 00:49:48,558
~ Our vow to Iove for a thousand years ... ~

361
00:50:00,206 --> 00:50:05,668
~ Is sealed with this cup ... ~

362
00:50:43,791 --> 00:50:46,955
His voice sounds overjoyed !

363
00:50:51,298 --> 00:50:54,882
That is the voice of my late father .

364
00:51:03,644 --> 00:51:09,106
The entire House of Kutsuki was wiped out

365
00:51:09,233 --> 00:51:15,230
by Oda Nobunaga , that detestable Oda Nobunaga .

366
00:51:16,490 --> 00:51:20,860
The only survivors of the purge were her ladyship

367
00:51:20,995 --> 00:51:24,204
and myself , her nurse .

368
00:51:24,331 --> 00:51:31,374
But the spirit of the late daimyo lingers in the palace ,

369
00:51:31,505 --> 00:51:38,093
and it sings like this every time her ladyship dances .

370
00:51:40,639 --> 00:51:45,304
Is it not a splendid voice ?

371
00:51:48,480 --> 00:51:53,726
He 's expressing his delight at her ladyship 's impending marriage .

372
00:52:06,165 --> 00:52:10,751
Whenever I hear the voice of my late father ...

373
00:53:40,259 --> 00:53:44,970
It 's too early to rise . Please sleep as long as you like .

374
00:53:45,097 --> 00:53:47,430
What am I doing here ?

375
00:53:50,060 --> 00:53:51,926
What a thing to say

376
00:53:53,689 --> 00:53:56,932
as if you 'd forgotten everything .

377
00:54:04,032 --> 00:54:06,524
Is my lord awake ?

378
00:54:07,828 --> 00:54:14,746
Lead your husband by the hand to the spring and bathe him .

379
00:54:16,837 --> 00:54:20,421
I won 't intrude upon you any further .

380
00:54:45,699 --> 00:54:49,909
You have such a look of distrust on your face .

381
00:54:50,037 --> 00:54:54,873
You think I 'm some kind of enchantress , don 't you ?

382
00:55:01,548 --> 00:55:06,760
But you 're mine , you belong to me now .

383
00:55:12,935 --> 00:55:19,102
From now on , you must devote your entire life to me .

384
00:55:53,433 --> 00:55:56,767
~ This Iove ~

385
00:55:59,147 --> 00:56:04,643
~ This Iove of ours ~

386
00:56:04,778 --> 00:56:10,740
~ Has driven me to madness ... ~

387
00:56:20,586 --> 00:56:23,624
Even if you are a ghost or enchantress ,

388
00:56:23,755 --> 00:56:26,668
I 'll never let you go .

389
00:56:31,346 --> 00:56:34,839
I never imagined such pleasures existed .

390
00:56:43,483 --> 00:56:46,851
This is exquisite ! It 's paradise !

391
00:57:11,136 --> 00:57:14,095
Help me ! Help me !

392
00:57:16,892 --> 00:57:19,100
Somebody , please help !

393
00:57:23,231 --> 00:57:26,224
Someone , help me !

394
00:57:36,620 --> 00:57:38,612
See any food ?

395
00:57:58,600 --> 00:58:00,557
Quickly , quickly !

396
00:58:01,937 --> 00:58:05,977
Pull yourself together . Come with me .

397
00:58:20,539 --> 00:58:22,656
Come quickly !

398
00:58:22,791 --> 00:58:29,038
- Take these rice cakes and this . - I 'll never forget your kindness .

399
00:58:29,172 --> 00:58:32,256
You 'll be all right if you take the back road .

400
00:58:32,384 --> 00:58:35,968
- To the left . - Many thanks .

401
00:58:36,096 --> 00:58:38,304
Be careful .

402
00:58:43,145 --> 00:58:44,761
Here !

403
00:58:46,481 --> 00:58:48,848
It 's mine !

404
00:59:08,253 --> 00:59:13,544
- Hey ... you got any food ? - We 're starving to death .

405
00:59:23,769 --> 00:59:28,605
That food 's for my son . Please don 't take it !

406
01:01:28,143 --> 01:01:30,385
Do me the honour of beheading me .

407
01:02:34,668 --> 01:02:37,957
I 've brought you a head ! A head ! A general 's head !

408
01:02:38,088 --> 01:02:40,421
Please , my lord !

409
01:02:40,548 --> 01:02:44,087
- What is it ? - Please look at this !

410
01:02:50,976 --> 01:02:54,310
You found the head of a great general .

411
01:02:54,437 --> 01:02:59,148
No , I didn 't find it , my lord . I killed him with my spear !

412
01:03:01,027 --> 01:03:03,940
Who 'd believe a warrior like Fuwa Katsuhige

413
01:03:04,072 --> 01:03:07,190
would let a mere foot soldier kill him ?

414
01:03:07,325 --> 01:03:11,194
A lucky find , but you 'll be rewarded all the same .

415
01:03:11,329 --> 01:03:14,493
What would you like ?

416
01:03:14,624 --> 01:03:18,288
A horse , armour and vassals .

417
01:03:18,420 --> 01:03:20,958
Very well . You shall have them .

418
01:03:22,674 --> 01:03:24,666
Thank you , my lord !

419
01:03:24,801 --> 01:03:26,838
You 're a clever one , aren 't you ?

420
01:03:46,573 --> 01:03:50,317
He looks like a fine samurai . What clan does he belong to ?

421
01:03:50,452 --> 01:03:54,071
- He killed Fuwa , the great general . - What 's his name ?

422
01:03:54,205 --> 01:03:57,698
Tobei of Nakanogo , one of Lord Niwa 's top men .

423
01:03:57,834 --> 01:04:00,827
Pay homage , that you may be so lucky .

424
01:04:02,797 --> 01:04:07,792
Beautiful girls are waiting for brave warriors !

425
01:04:07,927 --> 01:04:13,218
We have the finest sake and fish ! Please come inside !

426
01:04:14,684 --> 01:04:16,596
I can 't let you pass , sir !

427
01:04:16,728 --> 01:04:20,392
Come and look . We have beautiful girls inside .

428
01:04:20,523 --> 01:04:24,062
- What 's going on ? - Chief , perhaps we can rest here .

429
01:04:24,194 --> 01:04:27,187
No , I 'm heading directly home .

430
01:04:27,322 --> 01:04:30,861
I have someone waiting for me , and she must see me in all my glory .

431
01:04:30,992 --> 01:04:33,985
Chief , why not let us celebrate your triumph ?

432
01:04:34,120 --> 01:04:38,990
- Your men are looking forward to it . - I see . Very well .

433
01:04:40,377 --> 01:04:45,213
I , Nakanogo Tobei of Lord Niwa 's army , will rest here .

434
01:04:45,340 --> 01:04:49,459
- Prepare some tables . - He 'll rest here . Show your gratitude .

435
01:04:49,594 --> 01:04:51,711
Thank you , sir .

436
01:05:02,440 --> 01:05:04,147
Make way !

437
01:05:05,443 --> 01:05:08,527
Clear the way for Master Tobei !

438
01:05:24,337 --> 01:05:26,124
Welcome .

439
01:05:28,800 --> 01:05:32,009
- Which one is this Tobei ? - Him , over there .

440
01:05:32,137 --> 01:05:33,471
Him ?

441
01:05:34,180 --> 01:05:36,888
I heard of his great exploits .

442
01:05:43,106 --> 01:05:46,474
May I drink from your cup so your luck rubs off on me ?

443
01:05:46,609 --> 01:05:48,145
Me , too !

444
01:05:48,278 --> 01:05:51,897
How did you manage to kill such a great general ?

445
01:05:52,031 --> 01:05:55,900
Yes , tell us , so we may do as you did !

446
01:05:56,035 --> 01:05:58,368
A guide for future action !

447
01:05:58,496 --> 01:06:01,455
There 's nothing much to tell .

448
01:06:01,583 --> 01:06:04,792
First , you need brains . You need knowledge .

449
01:06:04,919 --> 01:06:08,913
Then , a strong arm . Skill on the battlefield .

450
01:06:09,048 --> 01:06:10,914
Martial artistry .

451
01:06:11,050 --> 01:06:16,967
Speed to seize the moment . The ability to see life in perspective .

452
01:06:17,098 --> 01:06:21,843
Then you 'll be wise as Kongming , the great Chinese military strategist .

453
01:06:21,978 --> 01:06:25,142
But above all , keep a clear , discerning mind .

454
01:06:25,273 --> 01:06:28,107
- Got that ? - Indeed .

455
01:06:28,234 --> 01:06:31,978
For military tactics , study the Kusunoki and Koshu schools .

456
01:06:32,113 --> 01:06:37,029
For firearms , Kanamaru school . For the spear , Otsubo school .

457
01:06:37,160 --> 01:06:41,495
Next you need to know fortifications and fortresses .

458
01:06:41,623 --> 01:06:47,244
Then defensive tactics , V-formations and the like ...

459
01:06:56,054 --> 01:06:59,343
Hey ! My money !

460
01:06:59,474 --> 01:07:01,636
Let me go !

461
01:07:04,771 --> 01:07:06,603
Crazy bitch !

462
01:07:06,731 --> 01:07:10,566
- Someone stop him ! - Hey , what 's going on ?

463
01:07:10,693 --> 01:07:15,358
- Let go of me ! - He 's trying to run off like a thief !

464
01:07:15,490 --> 01:07:18,483
I don 't give money to wenches like you .

465
01:07:21,120 --> 01:07:24,864
Scoundrel ! Making a plaything of me .

466
01:07:24,999 --> 01:07:27,662
This will do just fine , thanks !

467
01:07:30,213 --> 01:07:32,000
Ohama ! Ohama !

468
01:07:33,841 --> 01:07:36,254
So you 're the big man now ?

469
01:07:37,345 --> 01:07:42,010
You 've finally become the great samurai of your dreams , eh ?

470
01:07:46,271 --> 01:07:51,357
While you 've made your way to the top , I 've made quite a name for myself .

471
01:07:51,484 --> 01:07:57,025
In my fancy kimono and make-up , drinking fine sake ,

472
01:07:57,156 --> 01:08:00,149
I bed a different man every night .

473
01:08:00,285 --> 01:08:03,403
Some success for a woman , isn 't it ?

474
01:08:10,670 --> 01:08:13,378
Happy now ? This is what you wanted .

475
01:08:13,506 --> 01:08:17,841
Success always comes at a price , and we pay in suffering .

476
01:08:17,969 --> 01:08:22,760
I may be a fallen woman , but your success wipes the slate clean .

477
01:08:23,808 --> 01:08:25,299
Come !

478
01:08:25,435 --> 01:08:29,270
Be my customer tonight and we 'll celebrate .

479
01:08:29,397 --> 01:08:32,686
Buy this fallen woman with your money !

480
01:08:36,904 --> 01:08:38,904
Ohama .

481
01:08:39,198 --> 01:08:43,192
Without you , my success means nothing .

482
01:08:43,328 --> 01:08:48,494
That 's a lie ! My fate meant nothing , as long as you became a samurai .

483
01:08:48,625 --> 01:08:51,333
No , no , no , you 're wrong .

484
01:08:51,461 --> 01:08:53,293
Ohama !

485
01:08:55,715 --> 01:09:00,130
I thought you 'd be proud if I made good .

486
01:09:02,513 --> 01:09:07,258
I never dreamed you 'd be brought to this .

487
01:09:07,393 --> 01:09:09,976
I 'm a defiled woman .

488
01:09:14,442 --> 01:09:16,525
And you 're to blame !

489
01:09:17,904 --> 01:09:21,318
- Can you restore my honour ? - I can .

490
01:09:21,449 --> 01:09:24,533
- Otherwise , I have to die ! - I can !

491
01:09:24,661 --> 01:09:27,369
I swear I 'll restore your honour .

492
01:09:27,497 --> 01:09:30,240
How many times I 've wanted to die ,

493
01:09:30,375 --> 01:09:33,709
but I had to see you first !

494
01:09:33,836 --> 01:09:38,627
I hated myself for it , I hated myself ,

495
01:09:38,758 --> 01:09:41,375
but I couldn 't die without seeing you first !

496
01:09:41,511 --> 01:09:44,845
I couldn 't die ... I couldn 't die !

497
01:10:05,785 --> 01:10:07,401
This

498
01:10:09,664 --> 01:10:12,327
and this . Thank you .

499
01:10:12,458 --> 01:10:16,077
I don 't quite have enough . Could you lower the price ?

500
01:10:17,714 --> 01:10:21,082
In that case , I 'll take this back .

501
01:10:21,217 --> 01:10:23,049
I really wanted that .

502
01:10:23,177 --> 01:10:27,387
Come to Kutsuki Manor and I 'll pay you the rest .

503
01:10:27,515 --> 01:10:31,725
- Kutsuki Manor ? - Yes , at the foot of the mountain .

504
01:10:36,065 --> 01:10:38,148
Take it all ,

505
01:10:38,276 --> 01:10:40,142
and go away !

506
01:10:41,070 --> 01:10:44,780
Keep your money , too . Just go away !

507
01:10:55,126 --> 01:10:58,745
- Wait . - How can I help you , Priest ?

508
01:10:58,880 --> 01:11:02,044
I sense something evil ... an ill omen .

509
01:11:02,175 --> 01:11:06,294
- What is it ? - Let me look closely at your face .

510
01:11:06,429 --> 01:11:08,921
- My face ? - Yes .

511
01:11:09,056 --> 01:11:12,549
We can 't talk here . Please follow me .

512
01:11:12,685 --> 01:11:14,472
Very well ...

513
01:11:23,196 --> 01:11:27,190
The shadow of death is upon your face .

514
01:11:29,160 --> 01:11:33,871
Has some strange apparition crossed your path , perhaps ?

515
01:11:33,998 --> 01:11:36,456
No , not at all .

516
01:11:36,584 --> 01:11:41,500
Have you no home , no family ?

517
01:11:46,552 --> 01:11:50,546
If others depend on you , you must return to them at once .

518
01:11:51,891 --> 01:11:55,510
If you remain here any longer , you will forfeit your life .

519
01:11:55,645 --> 01:11:57,386
Return home quickly .

520
01:11:57,522 --> 01:11:59,354
But why ?

521
01:11:59,482 --> 01:12:03,146
Do not ask the reason . Your life is at stake .

522
01:12:04,821 --> 01:12:10,067
But I spend my days happily with Lady Wakasa at Kutsuki Manor .

523
01:12:10,201 --> 01:12:13,194
- She is a spirit of the dead . - What nonsense .

524
01:12:15,206 --> 01:12:18,995
This love of yours is forbidden .

525
01:12:21,212 --> 01:12:24,626
Do you not love your wife and child ?

526
01:12:24,757 --> 01:12:27,750
Would you forsake your life and abandon them , too ?

527
01:12:30,805 --> 01:12:32,421
Wait !

528
01:12:36,352 --> 01:12:39,470
Go then , if you must ,

529
01:12:39,605 --> 01:12:45,351
but I cannot let you walk into the jaws of death .

530
01:12:45,486 --> 01:12:48,103
I will exorcise this ghost .

531
01:12:49,240 --> 01:12:50,907
Come .

532
01:12:51,367 --> 01:12:57,079
When you realise how terrifying this spirit is ,

533
01:12:57,206 --> 01:12:59,539
you 'll come to your senses .

534
01:13:29,238 --> 01:13:32,857
Oh ... how beautiful !

535
01:13:40,207 --> 01:13:42,699
Such lovely jewellery !

536
01:13:51,344 --> 01:13:53,427
You 've made me so happy !

537
01:13:55,348 --> 01:13:57,931
How thoughtful of you , sir .

538
01:13:58,059 --> 01:14:00,927
I 'm so relieved .

539
01:14:01,062 --> 01:14:06,524
You were so late in returning that I grew terribly worried .

540
01:14:10,112 --> 01:14:13,321
But you look troubled , my dear .

541
01:14:13,449 --> 01:14:16,066
What has happened ?

542
01:14:18,829 --> 01:14:20,821
What is it ?

543
01:14:24,877 --> 01:14:28,871
You must not leave here again .

544
01:14:29,006 --> 01:14:33,046
Since the fall of our clan ,

545
01:14:33,177 --> 01:14:36,670
people have treated us with nothing but contempt

546
01:14:36,806 --> 01:14:40,516
and slander our name .

547
01:14:40,643 --> 01:14:43,727
What a wretched world !

548
01:14:43,854 --> 01:14:46,141
Genjuro ,

549
01:14:46,273 --> 01:14:51,268
I want you never to leave my side again .

550
01:14:51,404 --> 01:14:56,320
Let 's leave this manor and return to my native province .

551
01:15:00,079 --> 01:15:05,871
Genjuro , you are my husband for life .

552
01:15:06,002 --> 01:15:08,790
You will accompany me , won 't you ?

553
01:15:09,839 --> 01:15:12,297
Please forgive me .

554
01:15:13,634 --> 01:15:15,466
I 've been ...

555
01:15:18,264 --> 01:15:21,928
I 've been lying to you .

556
01:15:23,811 --> 01:15:27,600
I have a wife and child .

557
01:15:27,732 --> 01:15:32,978
I left them back home in the chaos of the war .

558
01:15:33,112 --> 01:15:36,401
You must leave all that behind you now .

559
01:15:36,532 --> 01:15:38,114
Please let me go !

560
01:15:38,242 --> 01:15:39,242
No !

561
01:15:40,369 --> 01:15:42,986
I refuse to let you go .

562
01:15:50,588 --> 01:15:56,209
So , you will come with me to my native province

563
01:16:00,139 --> 01:16:01,755
immediately .

564
01:16:02,683 --> 01:16:05,221
What is it , my lady ?

565
01:16:05,352 --> 01:16:09,642
- He has something on his skin ! - His skin ?

566
01:16:09,774 --> 01:16:12,767
Genjuro , did you ... ?

567
01:16:14,236 --> 01:16:17,729
- Did you ... ? - On your skin ?

568
01:16:19,784 --> 01:16:23,152
You must wash away what 's on your skin !

569
01:16:30,711 --> 01:16:35,046
Why did you wed her if you were already married ?

570
01:16:35,174 --> 01:16:40,135
I don 't know ... How could I have made such a terrible mistake ?

571
01:16:40,262 --> 01:16:44,222
A mistake for a man perhaps , but for a woman , it 's far worse .

572
01:16:44,350 --> 01:16:46,967
Please forgive me . Let me go .

573
01:16:47,103 --> 01:16:48,935
Certainly not !

574
01:16:50,940 --> 01:16:57,107
Wipe off those Sanskrit prayers to the Buddha and that curse ,

575
01:16:57,238 --> 01:16:59,855
or we will never forgive you !

576
01:17:01,492 --> 01:17:04,109
Genjuro ,

577
01:17:04,245 --> 01:17:11,618
how could you even think of doing something so dreadful ?

578
01:17:13,587 --> 01:17:20,585
All I wish is to remain forever by your side .

579
01:17:22,638 --> 01:17:24,630
For all eternity .

580
01:17:26,934 --> 01:17:29,642
Lady Wakasa departed this world

581
01:17:29,770 --> 01:17:35,357
without ever having known love in her life .

582
01:17:35,484 --> 01:17:39,819
It grieved my heart to see her so sorrowful .

583
01:17:39,947 --> 01:17:46,740
I wanted her ladyship to enjoy fully the pleasures of a woman 's life ,

584
01:17:47,830 --> 01:17:51,323
so I chose to return with her ,

585
01:17:51,458 --> 01:17:56,203
to wander this world .

586
01:17:56,922 --> 01:17:59,710
Our hopes were fulfilled

587
01:17:59,842 --> 01:18:03,461
when she met a good man like you

588
01:18:04,638 --> 01:18:09,724
and found a love that occurs only once a lifetime .

589
01:18:09,852 --> 01:18:15,064
And now , when she has at last found joy ,

590
01:18:15,191 --> 01:18:18,025
you speak of returning home ,

591
01:18:18,152 --> 01:18:22,817
never to see each other again .

592
01:18:22,948 --> 01:18:25,941
Does it not pain you to know

593
01:18:26,076 --> 01:18:32,789
that you may ruin her ladyship 's only chance of happiness ?

594
01:18:32,917 --> 01:18:36,331
Do you feel no remorse ?

595
01:18:36,462 --> 01:18:43,676
Master Genjuro , you must banish these dreadful thoughts

596
01:18:43,802 --> 01:18:49,048
and stay by her side forever ...

597
01:18:49,183 --> 01:18:52,847
Please forgive me ! Forgive me !

598
01:18:54,605 --> 01:18:56,267
Genjuro !

599
01:18:57,608 --> 01:18:59,691
Genjuro !

600
01:20:00,087 --> 01:20:01,919
This is the man !

601
01:20:02,047 --> 01:20:04,084
Hey , you ! Get up !

602
01:20:06,427 --> 01:20:10,717
- What are you doing ? - You shameless thief !

603
01:20:10,848 --> 01:20:13,841
You stole a sacred treasure from the shrine .

604
01:20:13,976 --> 01:20:18,391
- You 're wrong ! I didn 't steal it . - Silence !

605
01:20:18,522 --> 01:20:21,014
This sacred sword disappeared a month ago .

606
01:20:21,150 --> 01:20:24,985
That can 't be ! It belongs to Lady Wakasa at Kutsuki Manor .

607
01:20:25,112 --> 01:20:27,900
- Kutsuki Manor , you say ? - That 's right !

608
01:20:29,575 --> 01:20:31,487
You must 've been dreaming .

609
01:20:31,618 --> 01:20:34,406
This is where it stood before the clan was wiped out .

610
01:20:34,538 --> 01:20:36,530
He 's lying through his teeth !

611
01:20:36,665 --> 01:20:39,874
Where in the manor did you find the sword ?

612
01:20:40,002 --> 01:20:42,335
He 's suspicious . Search him .

613
01:20:46,300 --> 01:20:48,667
That 's my money ! Give it back !

614
01:20:48,802 --> 01:20:52,796
Silence ! In peace time , we 'd throw you in jail ,

615
01:20:52,931 --> 01:20:55,218
but Shibata 's army burned it down .

616
01:20:55,351 --> 01:20:58,219
Be thankful for that , you lucky bastard .

617
01:21:25,839 --> 01:21:30,839
~ The finest silk ~

618
01:21:36,266 --> 01:21:41,266
~ Of choicest hue ~

619
01:21:47,486 --> 01:21:54,279
~ May change and fade away ~

620
01:21:54,410 --> 01:21:59,744
~ As would my life ~

621
01:22:01,291 --> 01:22:05,376
~ My beloved ... ~

622
01:23:13,071 --> 01:23:14,562
Miyagi .

623
01:23:16,450 --> 01:23:18,032
Miyagi !

624
01:23:43,810 --> 01:23:47,679
- I 'm sorry I was gone so long . - You 're back !

625
01:23:47,814 --> 01:23:54,186
I knew you 'd be worried about me . But you 're all right ...

626
01:23:54,321 --> 01:23:56,984
I 'm so happy to see you 're all right .

627
01:23:58,909 --> 01:24:01,902
- Genichi ? - He 's asleep .

628
01:24:02,037 --> 01:24:05,246
Let me hold him , let me hold him .

629
01:24:09,753 --> 01:24:11,244
Genichi ...

630
01:24:11,380 --> 01:24:14,919
Genichi , I 'm back ! I 'm back !

631
01:24:15,050 --> 01:24:21,297
Your father 's returned . Let me hold you , let me hold you ...

632
01:24:25,727 --> 01:24:31,894
I wanted to bring you back fine presents , but this is all I have .

633
01:24:33,151 --> 01:24:36,815
I ... I made a terrible mistake !

634
01:24:36,947 --> 01:24:42,067
Don 't say another word , my dear . You 've returned safely to us .

635
01:24:45,914 --> 01:24:51,831
I realise now how right you were . My mind was warped .

636
01:24:51,962 --> 01:24:54,375
Let 's not speak of it anymore .

637
01:24:56,008 --> 01:24:58,591
You must be exhausted .

638
01:24:58,719 --> 01:25:01,507
I have some sake prepared .

639
01:25:18,864 --> 01:25:21,823
And there 's a stew ready in the pot .

640
01:26:08,997 --> 01:26:12,286
I feel so relieved .

641
01:26:14,836 --> 01:26:17,453
Sake never tasted so good .

642
01:26:22,761 --> 01:26:25,219
It 's so peaceful here .

643
01:26:30,102 --> 01:26:34,437
Come , Genichi . I 'll put you to bed .

644
01:26:40,070 --> 01:26:46,067
I haven 't had a moment 's peace since I left here ,

645
01:26:46,201 --> 01:26:51,287
but I 'm home at last ... home at last ...

646
01:26:51,415 --> 01:26:57,286
Home at last ... home at last ...

647
01:30:26,338 --> 01:30:30,753
Is someone in there ? Open the door !

648
01:30:32,177 --> 01:30:34,965
Is someone in there ? Open up .

649
01:30:40,644 --> 01:30:45,105
- Village chief ! - Genjuro ! You 're back ?

650
01:30:45,231 --> 01:30:49,396
Yes . Thank you for all your kindness in my absence .

651
01:30:52,280 --> 01:30:54,693
Oh , there you are , my boy !

652
01:30:54,824 --> 01:30:57,737
I was worried , I didn 't know where you 'd gone .

653
01:30:57,869 --> 01:30:59,576
What a relief .

654
01:31:02,540 --> 01:31:04,748
What a relief .

655
01:31:04,876 --> 01:31:08,369
The boy must have heard you were back .

656
01:31:08,505 --> 01:31:10,588
Hey , Miyagi ...

657
01:31:10,715 --> 01:31:12,206
Miyagi !

658
01:31:14,302 --> 01:31:16,294
Genjuro ...

659
01:31:16,429 --> 01:31:18,842
Are you dreaming ?

660
01:31:18,974 --> 01:31:20,931
Dreaming ?

661
01:31:21,059 --> 01:31:25,099
Miyagi was killed by soldiers of the defeated army .

662
01:31:26,481 --> 01:31:28,143
Killed ?

663
01:31:31,569 --> 01:31:36,531
She 'd have been so happy to see you back safely .

664
01:31:36,631 --> 01:31:39,817
Poor thing .

665
01:31:42,580 --> 01:31:44,822
Merciful Buddha ...

666
01:31:50,292 --> 01:31:53,130
Ever since Miyagi died ,

667
01:31:53,258 --> 01:31:56,342
I 've been looking after your boy in my house .

668
01:31:56,469 --> 01:32:00,463
I was so afraid when he suddenly disappeared last night .

669
01:32:03,164 --> 01:32:06,015
The bond between parent and child is strong .

670
01:32:06,345 --> 01:32:11,016
But how could he have known that you 'd returned ?

671
01:32:28,735 --> 01:32:31,978
To hell with this ... and this

672
01:32:34,908 --> 01:32:36,524
and this !

673
01:32:38,161 --> 01:32:43,953
I told you so , but you were too stupid to learn except through misfortune .

674
01:32:44,084 --> 01:32:47,998
The war drove us mad with ambition .

675
01:32:49,339 --> 01:32:52,548
Don 't let my suffering be in vain .

676
01:32:52,676 --> 01:32:55,794
Pull yourself together and work hard .

677
01:33:16,866 --> 01:33:18,823
Why did you have to die ?

678
01:33:20,620 --> 01:33:23,909
Miyagi , why did you have to die ?

679
01:33:42,267 --> 01:33:45,260
I did not die .

680
01:33:45,395 --> 01:33:48,308
I am at your side .

681
01:33:49,983 --> 01:33:53,317
Your delusion has come to an end .

682
01:33:54,904 --> 01:34:00,320
You are again your true self , in the place where you belong .

683
01:34:01,619 --> 01:34:04,703
Your work is waiting ...

684
01:34:16,718 --> 01:34:20,553
What a beautiful shape !

685
01:34:22,682 --> 01:34:29,179
Helping you spin the wheel is my greatest pleasure .

686
01:34:30,774 --> 01:34:33,858
How I long to see it when it 's fired .

687
01:34:35,820 --> 01:34:37,812
The firewood is cut and ready .

688
01:34:38,948 --> 01:34:42,362
The rampaging soldiers are gone .

689
01:34:42,494 --> 01:34:47,080
So make your wonderful pottery in peace .

690
01:34:52,629 --> 01:34:55,622
So many things have happened .

691
01:34:58,510 --> 01:35:04,256
You 've finally become the man I had hoped for .

692
01:35:04,390 --> 01:35:06,598
But , alas

693
01:35:08,728 --> 01:35:13,223
I am no longer among the living .

694
01:35:15,318 --> 01:35:18,982
Such is the way of the world .

695
01:35:40,301 --> 01:35:43,214
You must be tired . Rest a while .

696
01:35:53,565 --> 01:35:55,602
Here , Genichi . It 's delicious .

697
01:35:55,733 --> 01:35:58,225
Eat it while it 's hot .

698
01:35:58,361 --> 01:36:00,899
Brother , eat before it gets cold .

